# Cached API responses - 12MB, 577 files, all regenerable by fpl_data.py
data/cache/

# data/players.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is generated from the cache,
# so it looks disposable, but it is the only file the solver needs and it is the
# one thing a sandboxed session cannot rebuild - refreshing it requires reaching
# premierleague.com, which a cloud container's egress proxy blocks. Committing it
# is what lets the picker run somewhere other than James's desktop.

# Local backups and Python bytecode
*.bak
__pycache__/
*.pyc
